      "text": "In the event of any security incident or unauthorized access involving personal data, the Vendor reserves the right to determine at its sole discretion whether to inform the Customer, and may provide such notice within a timeframe exceeding thirty business days without any strict operational deadlines."
    },
    {
      "slot": "p2",
      "text": "The Vendor shall process personal data strictly for the explicit service objectives for which it was originally collected, save for instances where data is aggregated or anonymized for internal statistical research and capacity planning."
    },
    {
      "slot": "p3",
      "text": "The Customer shall engage subcontractors who maintain appropriate technical safeguards and operational measures, subject to periodic reviews conducted at reasonable intervals during the term of this Agreement."
